              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Naga jwamlume akukamulwa ali mkutenda cikululu ni jwamkongwe jwamsyene awulajidwe wosopewo, jwamlume pamo ni jwamkongwejo. Pakutenda myoyo timcityosya cakusakala celeci pasikati penu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
