          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwine mwakwe jwamlume akukamulwa mu msinda uwowo ali mkutenda ali mkutenda cikululu ni mwali jwamtomeledwe, jwakanam'manye jwamlume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwajigale wosopewo, mkopoce nawo kusa kwa msinda, ni mwawulaje pakwasoma ni maganga. Jwalakwejo akwenela kuwulajidwa ligongo jwalakwejo nginagumila kuti ŵandu amkamucisye. Jwamlumejo awulajidwe ligongo alemwisye ni mwali jwamtomeledwe ni mundu jwine. Myoyo timcityosya cakusakala camtundu welewo pasikati penu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
