          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwine mwakwe mundu jwamlume jwine, akumkamulila mwali jwamtomeledwe ni kutenda najo cikululu mwakumkanganicisya, kwitinji kwamti myoyo. Naga yili myoyo mundu jwamlume pejo ni jwakwenela kuwulajidwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwamkongwejo mkamtenda kandu kalikose, ligongo nginatenda cindu cakulemwa cakwenela kuwulajidwa. Magambo gelega gakulandana ni magambo gakuti, mundu amtandite mele mjakwe ni akuwulajidwa jwakupatandajo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwamlumejo atesile kumkamulila jwamkongwe ni kutenda najo cikululu kwitinji. Atamose kuti jwamkongwejo ŵagumisile, paliji pangali mundu jwakamkulupwisye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
