              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwine mundu jwamlume akukamulwa ali mkumkamulila mwali jwangatomeledwa, soni jwangamanyilila ŵalume, ni akutenda najo cikululu mwakumkanganicisya.",
          "type": "text",
